sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant UI as Frontend UI
    participant Rust as Rust Core
    participant Agent as Main Agent<br/>(Python :8001)
    participant Maint as Maintenance<br/>(Python :8002)
    participant Embed as Embeddings<br/>(Python :8003)
    participant Ollama as Ollama<br/>(Local)
    participant Qdrant as Vector DB
    participant FS as File System
    participant Cloud as Cloud API<br/>(Claude/GPT)

    User->>UI: Types message: "Summarize my auth notes"
    UI->>Rust: WebSocket: {message, project_id}
    
    Note over Rust: Tool Coordinator activated
    
    Rust->>Agent: POST /agent/chat<br/>{message, context, tools}
    Agent->>Ollama: Chat with function calling
    Ollama-->>Agent: Response with tool_calls:<br/>[search, read_file, write_file]
    Agent-->>Rust: {response, tool_calls}
    
    Note over Rust: Execute tool calls sequentially
    
    rect rgb(200, 220, 240)
        Note over Rust,Qdrant: Tool 1: search("auth notes")
        Rust->>Embed: POST /embed<br/>{text: "auth notes"}
        Embed->>Embed: Generate embedding vector
        Embed-->>Rust: {embedding: [0.1, 0.2, ...]}
        Rust->>Qdrant: Search similar vectors
        Qdrant-->>Rust: Top 5 matches with metadata
        Rust->>Rust: Add to tool results
    end
    
    rect rgb(240, 220, 200)
        Note over Rust,FS: Tool 2: read_file("auth/strategy.md")
        Rust->>FS: Read file
        FS-->>Rust: File content
        Rust->>Rust: Add to tool results
    end
    
    rect rgb(220, 240, 200)
        Note over Rust,FS: Tool 3: write_file("summary.md", content)
        Rust->>FS: Write new file
        FS-->>Rust: Success
        Rust->>Rust: Log breadcrumb
    end
    
    Rust-->>UI: Stream response + tool activity
    UI-->>User: Display chat + "Created summary.md"
    
    Note over Rust,Cloud: Background: File change detected
    
    par Background Processing
        Rust->>Embed: POST /embed<br/>{text: file_content}
        Embed-->>Rust: {embedding}
        Rust->>Qdrant: Store embedding + metadata
        
        and Summary Generation
        Rust->>Maint: POST /maintenance/summarize<br/>{filepath, content}
        Maint->>Cloud: Claude API: Generate summary
        Cloud-->>Maint: 2-3 sentence summary
        Maint-->>Rust: {summary, tags}
        Rust->>Qdrant: Update metadata with summary
        
        and Breadcrumb Logging
        Rust->>FS: Append to session_log.md
    end
    
    Note over UI: User clicks on "summary.md" in file browser
    
    UI->>Rust: GET /file/summary.md
    Rust->>FS: Read file
    FS-->>Rust: Content
    Rust-->>UI: {content, metadata, summary}
    UI-->>User: Display in side panel
    
    Note over Rust,Cloud: Periodic: Workspace Health Check
    
    Rust->>Maint: POST /maintenance/analyze
    Maint->>Maint: Analyze file structure,<br/>detect stale content
    Maint->>Cloud: Claude API: Generate suggestions
    Cloud-->>Maint: Reorganization ideas
    Maint-->>Rust: {suggestions, health_score}
    Rust->>UI: Notification badge
    UI-->>User: "💡 3 new suggestions"
